---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slajd 09 - Bias architektoniczny"
  bgImage="/images/background-3.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.80), rgba(10,14,23,0.91))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="phase-badge">
      <span class="phase-letter">O</span>
      <span class="phase-name">Orient</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="title">
      Bias <span class="highlight">architektoniczny</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="bias-map" aria-label="Dwa filtry interpretacyjne prowadzące od tego samego problemu do różnych decyzji">
      <article class="problem-card">
        <div class="problem-icon"><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i></div>
        <p class="card-label">Ten sam problem</p>
        <h2>System coraz trudniej rozwijać</h2>
        <p>Rosną zależności, czas wdrożeń i liczba miejsc, w których zmiana może coś zepsuć.</p>
      </article>

      <div class="path path--mono">
        <article class="bias-card">
          <header>
            <span class="bias-chip">Bias monolitu</span>
            <i class="ti ti-building"></i>
          </header>
          <blockquote>Pozostajemy przy obecnym modelu</blockquote>
          <p>Zespół dobrze zna jego ograniczenia i sposoby obchodzenia problemów.</p>
        </article>

        <div class="path-arrow"><i class="ti ti-arrow-down"></i></div>

        <article class="decision-card">
          <p class="card-label">Decyzja</p>
          <h3>Utrzymać obecny model architektoniczny</h3>
          <p>Ryzyko: Problemy z modularnością, zależnościami i niezależnością wdrożeń pozostają ukryte pod pozorną stabilnością znanego rozwiązania.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="path path--micro">
        <article class="bias-card">
          <header>
            <span class="bias-chip">Bias mikroserwisów</span>
            <i class="ti ti-sitemap"></i>
          </header>
          <blockquote>Przechodzimy na mikroserwisy</blockquote>
          <p>Organizacja traktuje je jako domyślną odpowiedź na problemy skalowania i szybkości rozwoju</p>
        </article>

        <div class="path-arrow"><i class="ti ti-arrow-down"></i></div>

        <article class="decision-card">
          <p class="card-label">Decyzja</p>
          <h3>Rozproszyć system</h3>
          <p>Ryzyko: System może zyskać większą złożoność operacyjną, trudniejsze debugowanie i zależności sieciowe bez rozwiązania pierwotnego problemu projektowego.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="principle">
      <i class="ti ti-brain"></i>
      <span>Zła decyzja często zaczyna się nie od braku danych, tylko od <strong>błędnej interpretacji</strong>.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1640px;
    padding: 54px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .phase-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 10px 22px 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .phase-letter {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--cyan-400);
    color: #0a0e17;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .phase-name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 76px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.3s forwards;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 1220px;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.42;
    color: rgba(240, 244, 248, 0.78);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 0.45s forwards;
  }

  .lede-accent {
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bias-map {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1420px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .problem-card,
  .bias-card,
  .decision-card {
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.58);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.20);
    border-radius: 16px;
    text-align: left;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .problem-card {
    min-height: 402px;
    padding: 34px 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 0.6s forwards;
  }

  .problem-icon {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.38);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 31px;
  }

  .card-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .problem-card h2 {
    font-size: 35px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: #f0f4f8;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .problem-card > p:last-child {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.42;
    color: #aebbd0;
  }

  .path {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 46px 138px;
    gap: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .path--mono {
    animation-delay: 0.78s;
  }

  .path--micro {
    animation-delay: 0.96s;
  }

  .bias-card {
    min-height: 218px;
    padding: 24px 26px 22px;
  }

  .path--mono .bias-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.74), rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.58));
  }

  .path--micro .bias-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.20), rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.58));
    border-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.36);
  }

  .bias-card header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .bias-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 34px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.34);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .path--micro .bias-chip {
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.13);
    border-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.42);
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .bias-card header i {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.32);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 24px;
  }

  .path--micro .bias-card header i {
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.34);
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .bias-card blockquote {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #f0f4f8;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .bias-card p {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #aebbd0;
  }

  .path-arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 36px;
  }

  .path--micro .path-arrow {
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .decision-card {
    padding: 20px 24px 18px;
    background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.46);
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .path--mono .decision-card {
    border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.36);
  }

  .path--micro .decision-card {
    border-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.42);
  }

  .decision-card h3 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #f0f4f8;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .decision-card p:last-child {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.36;
    color: #aebbd0;
  }

  .principle {
    width: min(980px, calc(100% - 560px));
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-left: 62px;
    min-height: 76px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 54px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 22px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.22), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.62));
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.42);
    color: #dbeafe;
    text-align: left;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 1.16s forwards;
  }

  .principle i {
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.34);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .principle span {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.34;
  }

  .principle strong {
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
